teal_ppl: [9.5, 12.0]\n      kl_30pct_uniform_mmlu_mean: [0.36, 0.39]\n      kl_25pct_uniform_ppl: [7.8, 8.8]\n      kl_35pct_uniform_ppl: [9.2, 10.5]\n      mask_divergence_30pct: [0.30, 0.42]\n    narrative_direction: \"调整 Contribution 1：'KL discovers substantially different mask patterns; these patterns are the dominant factor in quality advantage, but the KL training process itself contributes residual quality beyond mask selection alone.' 从 'masks are everything' 降级为 'masks are the primary factor with loss-dependent residual.' 补强策略：(1) 扩展 downstream benchmark 覆盖（HellaSwag 0.727, PIQA 0.760, BoolQ 0.769 已有 KL@30% 数据）；(2) C1 ablation 在多个 sparsity level 重复以展示 trend 而非单点；(3) Contribution 3 regime analysis 升格为并列核心贡献。EMNLP Main 可行但需更精细 positioning，Abstract/Introduction 措辞从 'we discover' 降为 'we identify and characterize'。\"\n\n  worst:\n    meaning: \"C1 ablation 失败或 BCE@30% 接近 KL——mask pattern discovery 不成立，需重新定位论文贡献\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"C1 ablation oracle agreement < 0.85 或 uniform PPL gap vs KL > 15%：mask quality 无法脱离 KL loss 独立解释优势\"\n      - \"standard BCE@30% TEAL PPL < 9.5：standard BCE 在推荐 operating point 接近 KL，mask 不是瓶颈\"\n      - \"mask divergence 在 30% < 30%：低 sparsity 时 KL 和 magnitude masks 趋同，53% divergence 仅是高 sparsity artifact\"\n      - \"25%/35% sweep 显示单调退化，无 regime 转折\"\n    number_ranges:\n      c1_ablation_uniform_ppl: [11.0, 16.0]\n      c1_ablation_oracle_agreement: [0.70, 0.85]\n      bce_30pct_teal_ppl: [8.5, 9.5]\n      kl_30pct_uniform_mmlu_mean: [0.33, 0.36]\n      kl_25pct_uniform_ppl: [8.2, 9.5]\n      kl_35pct_uniform_ppl: [9.8, 12.0]\n      mask_divergence_30pct: [0.15, 0.32]\n    narrative_direction: \"放弃 mask pattern discovery。Reframe 为 'When Does Output-Distribution Distillation Matter for Sparse Inference?'——一个 loss × allocation × sparsity × scale 四维交互的系统性 empirical study。核心贡献重组：(1) KL 的 PPL 优势跨 scale 稳健但 downstream 优势仅在 high-sparsity/PPL-sensitive regime 显著——quantifying WHEN KL matters；(2) compensation network unnecessary (negative result with positive practical impact: −67.2M params)；(3) PPL ≠ downstream quality 的 scale-dependent disconnect（8B vs 14B）；(4) allocation-sparsity interaction 三 regime 作为 practitioner guideline。从 discovery paper 转为 'the first comprehensive practitioners' guide to loss/allocation/sparsity selection for SwiGLU activation sparsity'。补充实验深度：per-layer error decomposition、failure mode taxonomy、更多 14B 数据点。仍冲 EMNLP Main Efficient Methods（track 接受高质量 empirical analysis），但需显著加强 §5 Analysis 的粒度和洞察密度。\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":33900,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":33900},"output_tokens":19,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b20fdd82-07fe-4ec0-a09f-ffbdb7bb4357","uuid":"7c76faf1-17dd-4674-ac32-ffc00535e17b"}
